  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n**1) 12 and 16**\n\n→ **(96 ÷ 16)** + **(7)2** + 18 = 112 – **(12 × 3)** – **(69 ÷ 23)**\n\n→ **6 + 49 + 18** = 112 – 36 – 3\n\n→ 73 = **112 – 36 ****– 3**\n\n→ 73 = 73\n\n→ **LHS = RHS** ⇒ **Satisfies the equation.**\n\n**2) 18 and 16**\n\n→ **(96 ÷ 12)** + **(7)2** + 16 = 112 – **(18 × 3)** – **(69 ÷ 23)**\n\n→ **8 + 49 + 16** = 112 – 54 – 3\n\n→ 73 = **112 – 54 ****– 3**\n\n→ 73 ≠ 55\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**3) 7 and 3**\n\n→ **(96 ÷ 12)** + **(3)2** + 18 = 112 – **(16 × 7)** – **(69 ÷ 23)**\n\n→ **8 + 9 + 18** = 112 – 112 – 3\n\n→ 35 = **112 – 112 ****– 3**\n\n→ 35 ≠ - 3\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**4) 7 and 18**\n\n→ **(96 ÷ 12)** + **(18)2** + 7 = 112 – **(16 × 3)** – **(69 ÷ 23)**\n\n→ **8 + 324 + 7** = 112 – 48 – 3\n\n→ 339 = **112 – 48 ****– 3**\n\n→ 339 ≠ 61\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 1 satisfies the equation. \n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"12 and 16\"**.",
